{"id":563,"date":"2026-08-15T14:42:45","date_gmt":"2026-08-15T14:42:45","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=563"},"modified":"2026-08-16T07:21:51","modified_gmt":"2026-08-16T07:21:51","slug":"theme-studio-backgrounds","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/master-themes\/theme-studio-backgrounds\/","title":{"rendered":"Theme Studio &#038; Backgrounds"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Theme Studio &amp; Backgrounds<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-570\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-154801-1.png\" alt=\"Theme Studio &amp; Backgrounds\" width=\"127\" height=\"129\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-154801-1.png 411w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-154801-1-295x300.png 295w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 127px) 100vw, 127px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The Theme Studio is Open Publisher&#8217;s document-wide design system, accessible from the <strong>Page Design<\/strong> ribbon tab. It lets you apply consistent visual styling &#8211; colour schemes and background textures &#8211; across your entire publication with a single click.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Colour Schemes<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher ships with a curated set of colour palette presets:<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-572\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-173302.png\" alt=\"Theme Studio\" width=\"411\" height=\"98\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-173302.png 1146w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-173302-300x71.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-173302-1024x244.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-173302-768x183.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 411px) 100vw, 411px\" \/><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Classic<\/strong> &#8211; clean, traditional publishing tones.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Pastel<\/strong> &#8211; soft, muted hues for a gentle aesthetic.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Neon<\/strong> &#8211; vivid, high-energy accent colours.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Corporate<\/strong> &#8211; professional, restrained blues and greys.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-587\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-173652-1.png\" alt=\"Colour Schemes\" width=\"118\" height=\"128\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-173652-1.png 411w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-173652-1-276x300.png 276w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 118px) 100vw, 118px\" \/>When a colour scheme is active, shapes, text elements, and other design objects dynamically respond by automatically updating their fills and strokes to match the active document colour language. The active scheme is highlighted in the ribbon so it is immediately obvious which palette is currently applied.<\/p>\n<p><!-- PLACEHOLDER FOR NANO BANANA SCREENSHOT: COLOUR SCHEMES RIBBON --><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\"><br \/>\nPage Background Themes<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-586\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174212-1.png\" alt=\"Page Background Themes\" width=\"124\" height=\"133\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174212-1.png 403w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174212-1-280x300.png 280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 124px) 100vw, 124px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Alongside colour schemes, the Theme Studio provides a library of <strong>page background themes<\/strong> &#8211; solid colours, gradients, and textured patterns &#8211; that can be applied to the entire document backdrop. Simply click any swatch in the Theme Studio panel to apply it instantly.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">Background themes are applied via a dedicated background layer that sits beneath all your content. Your selected theme is saved into your <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.opub<\/span> file and loads automatically when you re-open the document. Backgrounds applied through the Theme Studio render correctly in all export formats, including booklet printing with accurate gradient reproduction.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\"><em>Tip: If you need more precise control over individual background colours or want to apply a custom solid colour, use the <strong>Format Background<\/strong> dialog (see below).<\/em><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Format Background Dialog<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">For direct, one-off background colour control on the current page, use the <strong>Format Background<\/strong> dialog. Access it by:<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-590\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174631.png\" alt=\"Format Background Dialog\" width=\"276\" height=\"189\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174631.png 914w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174631-300x205.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174631-768x525.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 276px) 100vw, 276px\" \/><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-clicking anywhere on the page canvas and selecting <strong>Format Background<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Using the workspace context menu or the ribbon.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-591\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174623.png\" alt=\"Right Click context menu\" width=\"171\" height=\"226\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174623.png 440w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-174623-227x300.png 227w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 171px) 100vw, 171px\" \/><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The redesigned dialog features the application&#8217;s signature dark-teal header, cleanly styled radio buttons for selecting background type (solid colour, gradient), custom colour inputs, and a tip box directing you to the Theme Studio for advanced textures and patterns.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><!-- PLACEHOLDER FOR NANO BANANA SCREENSHOTS: FORMAT BACKGROUND DIALOG & CONTEXT MENU --><\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">Gradients applied via Format Background render correctly in all print modes, including Booklet printing.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Ignoring the Theme Background on Specific Pages<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Separately from the Master Page elements, Open Publisher&#8217;s <strong>Theme Studio<\/strong> can apply a decorative background to all pages simultaneously. If you need a single page (such as a back cover or a blank insert) to have a white\/plain background while the rest of the document keeps its theme background, use the <strong>Ignore Theme<\/strong> feature.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\"><strong>To exempt a page from the theme background:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Navigate to the page you want to exempt.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Open the <strong>Theme Studio<\/strong> ribbon (under Page Design).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click the <strong>Ignore Theme<\/strong> button (displayed with a teal cancel icon, next to the Remove Theme button).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><!-- PLACEHOLDER FOR NANO BANANA SCREENSHOT: IGNORE THEME CANVAS --><\/p>\n<p><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-602\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-175419.png\" alt=\"Ignoring the Theme Background on Specific Pages\" width=\"512\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-175419.png 1472w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-175419-300x176.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-175419-1024x600.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-175419-768x450.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" \/><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">The background on that page immediately turns white. All other pages retain their theme background intact. This override is fully supported in the standard print engine, the booklet imposition engine, and the PDF export pipeline.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Theme Studio &amp; Backgrounds The Theme Studio is Open Publisher&#8217;s document-wide design system, accessible from the Page Design ribbon tab. It lets you apply consistent visual styling &#8211; colour schemes and background textures &#8211; across your entire publication with a single click. Colour Schemes Open Publisher ships with a curated set of colour palette presets: [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":608,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[10],"class_list":["post-563","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-master-themes"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/563","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=563"}],"version-history":[{"count":32,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/563\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":567,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/563\/revisions\/567"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/608"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=563"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=563"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}